# The multi-stage Dockerfile builds from source (pom.xml, .mvn, mvnw, src),
# unlike Quarkus's own generated Dockerfile.jvm/.native which expect a
# pre-built target/ — this repo's Dockerfile does the Maven build itself, so
# it needs the source in its context. Everything that build produces or that
# the build never needs is excluded instead.
.git
target
docs
*.md
.github
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
